{"level":"error","message":"Failed to parse AI JSON response in generateProblem","raw":"{\n  \"title\": \"Longest Palindromic Subsequence\",\n  \"slug\": \"longest-palindromic-subsequence\",\n  \"description\": \"Given a string s, find the length of the longest palindromic subsequence in s. A subsequence is a sequence that can be derived from another sequence by deleting some or no elements without changing the order of the remaining elements.\",\n  \"referenceSolution\": \"function solve(input) { const s = JSON.parse(input); const n = s.length; const dp = Array.from({ length: n }, () => Array(n).fill(0)); for (let i = n - 1; i >= 0; i--) { dp[i][i] = 1; for (let j = i + 1; j < n; j++) { if (s[i] === s[j]) { dp[i][j] = dp[i + 1][j - 1] + 2; } else { dp[i][j] = Math.max(dp[i + 1][j], dp[i][j - 1]); } } } return dp[0][n - 1].toString(); }\",\n  \"testCases\": [\n    { \"input\": \"\\\"bbbab\\\"\", \"expected\": \"4\", \"isHidden\": false },\n    { \"input\": \"\\\"cbbd\\\"\", \"expected\": \"2\", \"isHidden\": false },\n    { \"input\": \"\\\"a\\\"\", \"expected\": \"1\", \"isHidden\": true },\n    { \"input\": \"\\\"abba\\\"\", \"expected\": \"4\", \"isHidden\": true },\n    { \"input\": \"\\\"abcde\\\"\", \"expected\": \"1\", \"isHidden\": true },\n    { \"input\": \"\\\"racecar\\\"\", \"expected\": \"7\", \"isHidden\": true },\n    { \"input\": \"\\\"\\\", \\\"expected\": \"0\", \"isHidden\": true },\n    { \"input\": \"\\\"aaaaa\\\"\", \"expected\": \"5\", \"isHidden\": true },\n    { \"input\": \"\\\"abcdedcba\\\"\", \"expected\": \"9\", \"isHidden\": true },\n    { \"input\": \"\\\"abacdfgdcaba\\\"\", \"expected\": \"6\", \"isHidden\": true }\n  ]\n}","service":"code-execution-backend api","timestamp":"2026-04-03T13:06:12.074Z"}
