{"level":"error","message":"AI returned invalid JSON in generateProblem","raw":"{\n  \"title\": \"Mysterious Message Decoder\",\n  \"slug\": \"mysterious-message-decoder\",\n  \"description\": \"You are a secret agent tasked with decoding a mysterious message. The message is encoded using a unique method where each character in the message is shifted by a specific pattern. The pattern is determined by the position of the character in the message and a given key. The key is a string of digits, and each digit represents the number of positions to shift the corresponding character in the message. The shift is circular, meaning if you shift 'z' by 1, it becomes 'a'. Your task is to decode the message using the key and return the original message.\\n\\nFunction Signature: `function decodeMessage(message: string, key: string): string`\\n\\nInput:\\n- `message`: A string representing the encoded message. (1 <= message.length <= 1000)\\n- `key`: A string of digits representing the shift pattern. (1 <= key.length <= message.length)\\n\\nOutput:\\n- A string representing the decoded message.\\n\\nConstraints:\\n- The message will only contain lowercase English letters and spaces.\\n- The key will only contain digits from 0 to 9.\\n\\nExamples:\\n1. Input: message = \\\"ifmmp\\\", key = \\\"12345\\\"\\n   Output: \\\"hello\\\"\\n2. Input: message = \\\"zab\\\", key = \\\"100\\\"\\n   Output: \\\"zab\\\"\",\n  \"referenceSolution\": \"function decodeMessage(message: string, key: string): string {\\n    const alphabet = 'abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz';\\n    let decodedMessage = '';\\n\\n    for (let i = 0; i < message.length; i++) {\\n        if (message[i] === ' ') {\\n            decodedMessage += ' ';\\n            continue;\\n        }\\n        const shift = parseInt(key[i % key.length], 10);\\n        const originalIndex = (alphabet.indexOf(message[i]) - shift + 26) % 26;\\n        decodedMessage += alphabet[originalIndex];\\n    }\\n\\n    return decodedMessage;\\n}\",\n  \"testCases\": [\n    {\"input\": \"\\\"ifmmp\\\", \\\"12345\\\"\", \"expected\": \"\\\"hello\\\"\", \"isHidden\": false},\n    {\"input\": \"\\\"zab\\\", \\\"100\\\"\", \"expected\": \"\\\"zab\\\"\", \"isHidden\": false},\n    {\"input\": \"\\\"gymnymph\\\", \\\"2468024680\\\"\", \"expected\": \\\"\\\"foxfoxfox\\\"\\\", \"isHidden\": true},\n    {\"input\": \"\\\"khoor\\\", \\\"33333\\\"\", \"expected\": \\\"\\\"hello\\\"\\\", \"isHidden\": true},\n    {\"input\": \\\"\\\"a b c\\\", \\\"1 2 3\\\"\", \"expected\": \\\"\\\"z y x\\\"\\\", \"isHidden\": true},\n    {\"input\": \\\"\\\"xyz\\\", \\\"100\\\"\", \"expected\": \\\"\\\"xyz\\\"\\\", \"isHidden\": true},\n    {\"input\": \\\"\\\"ifmmp xpsme\\\", \\\"1234567890\\\"\", \"expected\": \\\"\\\"hello world\\\"\\\", \"isHidden\": true}\n  ]\n}","service":"code-execution-backend api","timestamp":"2026-06-04T07:49:41.899Z"}
